n><\\/p><ul><li><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><i><span><strong>Lapel:<\\/strong> Luxury shawl lapel with subtle embellished detailing for a statement look<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><i><span><strong>Buttons:<\\/strong> Single-button front closure for a clean, formal profile<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><i><span><strong>Pockets:<\\/strong> One chest welt pocket and two front flap pockets<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><i><span><strong>Lining:<\\/strong> Smooth inner lining for comfortable wear and easy layering<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><i><span><strong>Stitching:<\\/strong> Precision stitching with reinforced seams for a premium finish<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><i><span><strong>Comfort &amp; Durability Features<\\/strong><\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><ul><li><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><i><span>Lightweight yet structured construction for long wear<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><i><span>Breathable inner lining to enhance comfort<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><i><span>Reinforced seams for extended durability<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><li><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><i><span>Shape-retaining tailoring for a consistently polished appearance<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul><p class=\\\"isSelectedEn