ement.<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><h2><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><u>Design Details<\\/u><\\/span><\\/h2><ul><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Lapel Style: Classic wide shawl lapel with a clean tuxedo finish<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Closure: Single-button front closure<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Buttons: Minimalist black designer buttons for contrast<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Pockets: Functional front flap pockets and a sleek chest pocket<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Lining: Fully lined interior for structure and durability<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Stitching: Precision tailoring with reinforced seams<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Detailing: Asymmetric floral embroidery on shoulder, sleeve, and lower front panel<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><h2><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><u>Comfort &amp; Durability Features<\\/u><\\/span><\\/h2><ul><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Lightweight construction suitable for extended wear<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Breathable lining helps regulate temperature<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Securely stitched embroidery for long-lasting elegance<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Fade-resistant fabric maintains color and finish over time<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><h2><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><u>Suitable Occasions<\\/u><\\/span><\\/h2><ul><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Weddings &amp; receptions<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Formal and black-tie events<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Engagement parties &amp; celebrations<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Fashion-forward office or business events<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:h