ative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\\\"><div class=\\\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\\\"><div class=\\\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\\\"><div class=\\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\\\"><div class=\\\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\\\"><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Fabric Composition &amp; Material Quality<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Crafted from a premium <strong>poly-viscose stretch blend fabric<\\/strong>, these trousers provide superior durability, wrinkle resistance, and breathable comfort. The smooth textured finish ensures a luxurious appearance while remaining lightweight for all-day wear.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Fit Type<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Modern Slim Fit<\\/strong> \\u2014 structured at the waist with a naturally tapered leg profile, creating a sleek elongated silhouette while allowing effortless mobility.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Design Details<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Signature Gurkha extended waistband with adjustable metal buckle side adjuster<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Reinforced double-button fastening with concealed zip fly closure<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Elegant single pleat front enhancing comfort and tailored drape<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Functional back welt pocket with button closure for practicality<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Deep side pockets designed for everyday convenience<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Sharp pressed crease for a refined formal finish<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Precision reinforced stitching ensuring premium craftsmanship<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Comfort &amp; Durability Features<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Breathable lightweight fabric suitable for extended wear<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Stretch flexibility supporting natural movement<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Wrinkle-resistant construction maintains a sharp look throughout the day<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Fade-resistant color treatment for long-lasting vibrancy<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Shape retention technology preserves structure and crease<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Suitable Occasions<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Perfect for executive office wear, business meetings, corporate events, weddings, formal ceremonies, evening receptions, smart casual gatherings, and luxury parties. Pairs effortlessly with dress shirts, blazers, knit polos, loafers, or formal footwear.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Care Instructions<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Dry clean recommended for best longevity. Gentle cold machine wash if necessary. Avoid bleach or harsh detergents. Steam or low-heat iron recommended. Hang properly to maintain crease and structure.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Available Sizes &amp; Colors<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Sizes:<\\/strong> 28, 30, 32, 34, 36, 38, 40 (Custom tailoring available)<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Colors:<\