wear, business meetings, corporate events, evening receptions, smart casual gatherings, and luxury parties. Perfectly pairs with dress shirts, knit polos, blazers, loafers, or formal footwear for a refined gentleman\\u2019s style.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Care Instructions<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Dry clean recommended for best longevity. Gentle cold machine wash if necessary. Avoid bleach or harsh detergents. Steam or low-heat iron recommended. Store on a hanger to maintain crease and structure.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Available Sizes &amp; Colors<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Sizes:<\\/strong> 28, 30, 32, 34, 36, 38, 40 (Custom tailoring available)<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Colors:<\\/strong> Stone Beige, Ivory White, Sand Beige, Chocolate Brown, Navy Blue, Classic Black, Charcoal Grey.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2b50 <strong>Timeless Gurkha tailoring crafted for confidence, comfort, and effortless elegance.<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/article><\\/div><div class=\\\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\",\"images\":[null,\"Men\\u2019s Premium Beige Gurkha  Trousers \\u2013 Modern Tailored Fit.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"specification_table_id\":null,\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"SF-2443-NBUT\",\"price\":\"2000\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"price_includes_tax\":\"0\",\"cost_per_item\":\"0\",\"product_id\":\"554\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":\"0\",\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_sta