span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Wrinkle-resistant finish for a sharp all-day appearance<\\/span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Fade-resistant color treatment for long-lasting freshness<\\/span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Shape retention technology maintains structure and crease<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Suitable Occasions<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Perfect for weddings, formal ceremonies, executive office wear, business meetings, corporate events, evening receptions, smart casual gatherings, and luxury parties. Easily pairs with dress shirts, knit polos, blazers, loafers, or formal footwear.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Care Instructions<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Dry clean recommended for best results. Gentle cold machine wash if necessary. Avoid bleach. Steam or low-heat iron recommended. Hang properly to maintain crease and structure.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Available Sizes &amp; Colors<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Sizes:<\\/strong> 28, 30, 32, 34, 36, 38, 40 (Custom tailoring available)<\\/span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Colors:<\\/strong> Ivory, Sand Beige, Chocolate Brown, Navy Blue, Classic Black, Charcoal Grey.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2b50 <strong>Timeless Gurkha craftsmanship designed for modern confidence \\u2014 elegance, comfort, and sophistication in every step.<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"549ee9ad-ec2f-41e9-8c93-3f45c79eb0da.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"specification_table_id\":null,\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"SF-2443-WCRY\",\"price\":\"2000\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"price_includes_tax\":\"0\",\"cost_pe