14 Fade-resistant color treatment for lasting freshness<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Shape retention technology prevents sagging<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Suitable Occasions<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Perfect for weddings, formal ceremonies, executive office wear, business meetings, corporate events, evening receptions, parties, and smart casual styling. Easily pairs with dress shirts, blazers, loafers, or formal footwear for a polished gentleman\\u2019s appearance.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Care Instructions<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Dry clean recommended for best results. Gentle cold machine wash if necessary. Avoid bleach. Steam or low-heat iron recommended. Store on a hanger to maintain crease and structure.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Available Sizes &amp; Colors<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Sizes:<\\/strong> 28, 30, 32, 34, 36, 38, 40 (Custom tailoring available)<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Colors:<\\/strong> Ivory, Sand Beige, Navy Blue, Classic Black, Charcoal Grey, Sky Blue.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2b50 <strong>Designed for confidence, comfort, and timeless luxury \\u2014 a true essential for the modern gentleman\\u2019s wardrobe.<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"2b4b9b3b-3558-4b43-b7cc-0eddfc2c137d.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"specification_table_id\":null,\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"SF-2443-TWNP\",\"price\":\"2000\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"price_includes_tax\":\"0\",\"cost_per_item\":\"0\",\"product_id\":\"551\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":\"0\",\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_st