 recommended. Hang properly to maintain crease lines and structure.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Available Sizes &amp; Colors<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Sizes:<\\/strong> 28, 30, 32, 34, 36, 38, 40 (Custom tailoring available)<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Colors:<\\/strong> Sand Beige, Ivory White, Navy Blue, Classic Black, Charcoal Grey, Sky Blue.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2b50 <strong>Designed for men who value timeless elegance, comfort, and confident tailoring in every step.<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/article><\\/div><div class=\\\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\",\"images\":[null,\"a364804b-7498-4225-9898-780506749dec.webp\",\"cc2cb6b9-5fd0-437d-9ead-888894d62318.webp\",\"3df6fc4c-fc6f-4df8-9dfc-0e6387effbab.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"specification_table_id\":null,\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"SF-2443-LUAL\",\"price\":\"2000\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"price_includes_tax\":\"0\",\"cost_per_item\":\"0\",\"product_id\":\"550\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":\"0\",\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"weight\":\"0\",\"length\":\"0\",\"wide\":\"0\",\"height\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"related_products\":null,\"faq_schema_config\":[[{\"key\":\"question\",\"value\":null},{\"key\":\"answer\",\"value\":null}]],\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"seo_description\":null,\"index\":\"index\"},\"seo_meta_image\":null,\"status\":\"published\",\"is_featured\":\"1\",\"is_new_until\":null,\"categories\":[\"33\",\"35\