:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Stretch flexibility allowing natural movement<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Wrinkle-resistant and fade-resistant finish<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Maintains shape and crease after repeated use<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Suitable Occasions<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Ideal for business meetings, executive office wear, formal ceremonies, weddings, professional events, evening parties, smart casual gatherings, and corporate travel. Easily pairs with blazers, dress shirts, loafers, or formal shoes for a polished gentleman\\u2019s look.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Care Instructions<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Dry clean recommended for best longevity. Gentle cold machine wash if necessary. Avoid bleach or harsh detergents. Steam or low-heat iron recommended. Hang properly to maintain crease and structure.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Available Sizes &amp; Colors<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Sizes:<\\/strong> 28, 30, 32, 34, 36, 38, 40 (Custom tailoring available)<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Colors:<\\/strong> Beige, Ivory White, Navy Blue, Classic Black, Charcoal Grey, Sky Blue.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2b50 <strong>Designed for confidence, comfort, and timeless elegance \\u2014 the perfect essential for every modern gentleman\\u2019s wardrobe.<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/article><\\/div><div class=\\\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0