ance with our Premium Ivory White Gurkha Pants \\u2014 designed for men who appreciate sharp tailoring and distinctive style. Featuring a sophisticated high-waist structure and signature double-button Gurkha closure, these trousers deliver timeless luxury with modern versatility for both professional and special occasions.<\\/span><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Fabric Composition &amp; Material Quality<\\/strong><\\/span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Crafted from a premium poly-viscose stretch blend, the fabric provides a smooth matte finish, excellent breathability, and wrinkle resistance. The durable weave maintains structure while offering softness and flexibility for all-day wear.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Fit Type<\\/strong><\\/span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Modern Slim Fit \\u2014 tailored at the waist and tapered through the legs to create a clean, elongated silhouette without compromising comfort or mobility.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Design Details<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p><ul><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Classic Gurkha high-waist design with extended waistband and double-button fastening<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Reinforced button closure with concealed zip fly for a sleek appearance<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Functional side pockets with clean back welt pockets<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Elegant front crease line enhancing a sharp formal look<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Soft inner waistband lining for comfort and durability<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Precision tailored stitching ensuring long-lasting structure and premium finishing<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Comfort &amp; Durability Features<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p><ul><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Lightweight breathable construction suitable for long hours<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Stretch flexibility for ease of movement<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Shape retention technology prevents sagging<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Fade and wrinkle resistant for a consistently polished look<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Suitable Occasions<\\/strong><\\/span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Perfect for weddings, formal ceremonies, business meetings, corporate wear, office styling, parties, events, and smart evening outfits.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Care Instructions<\\/strong><\\/span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Dry clean recommended for best results. Gentle cold machine wash if necessary. Avoid bleach or harsh detergents. Steam or low-heat iron recommended. Store on hanger to maintain crease and structure.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Available Sizes &amp; Colors<\\/strong><\\/span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Sizes: 28, 30, 32, 34, 36, 38, 40 (Custom tailoring available)<\\/span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Colors: Ivory White, Sky Blue, Navy Blue, Classic Black, Beige, Charcoal Grey.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"11489ecb-8ae7-42a1-92b1-6143eea6213d.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"specification_table_id\":null,\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"SF-2443-7KYR\",\"price\":\"2000\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"price_includes_tax\":\"0\",\"cost_per_item\":\"0\",\"product_id\":\"548\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":\"0\",\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"weight\":\"0\"