y-viscose stretch fabric blend<\\/strong>, these Gurkha trousers offer superior durability, wrinkle resistance, and breathable comfort. The smooth texture ensures a polished finish suitable for long hours of wear while maintaining shape retention.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Fit Type<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Modern Slim Fit<\\/strong> \\u2014 tailored through the waist and tapered along the leg for a sleek, structured appearance that enhances posture and style without compromising mobility.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Design Details<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><ul><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Waist Style:<\\/strong> Signature double side adjuster buckle system (Gurkha style) for a secure, belt-free fit<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Rise:<\\/strong> High-waisted structured design for a refined silhouette<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Closure:<\\/strong> Extended waistband tab with reinforced button fastening and concealed zip fly<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Pockets:<\\/strong> Deep side pockets with functional back welt pockets<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Lining:<\\/strong> Soft inner waistband lining for enhanced comfort<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Stitching:<\\/strong> Precision tailoring with reinforced seams for durability and premium finishing<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Comfort &amp; Durability Features<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><ul><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Stretch flexibility for natural movement<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Breathable lightweight construction suitable for all-day wear<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Wrinkle-resistant and fade-resistant fabric<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Maintains structure and crease after repeated use<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Suitable Occasions<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Perfect for:<\\/span><\\/p><ul><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Formal Events &amp; Weddings<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Business Meetings &amp; Corporate Wear<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Office &amp; Executive Styling<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Parties and Smart Evening Occasions<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Care Instructions<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><ul><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Dry clean recommended for long-lasting quality<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Gentle cold machine wash if necessary<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Do not bleach<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Steam or low-heat iron recommended<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Store on hanger to maintain crease and structure<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Available Sizes &amp; Colors<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><ul><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Sizes:<\\/strong> 28, 30, 32, 34, 36, 38, 40 (Custom sizing available)<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Colors:<\\/strong> Sky Blue, Navy Blue, Classic Black, Charcoal Grey, Ivory Beige<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Timeless tailoring meets modern luxury \\u2014 elevate your wardrobe with the sophistication of Gurkha craftsmanship.<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"Premium Sky Blue Gurkha Pants.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"ph