 look suitable for both professional and social settings<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p><strong>Fabric Composition &amp; Material Quality<\\/strong><br>Crafted from premium poly-viscose blended suiting fabric with a slight stretch, these trousers offer the ideal balance of structure, breathability, and durability.<br>Smooth, soft hand-feel with a clean matte finish<br>Wrinkle-resistant and color-stable material<br>Lightweight yet structured for year-round wear<br>Engineered to retain shape and crease over time<br><strong>Fit Type<\\/strong><br>Modern Tailored Fit \\u2013 High-waisted with a relaxed straight fall that creates a sharp, elongated silhouette while maintaining day-long comfort and mobility.<br><strong>Design Details<\\/strong><br>Waistband: Signature extended Gurkha waistband with adjustable metal side buckle for a personalized fit<br>Closure: Overlapping waistband with concealed zip fly and top button fastening<br>Pleats: Double front pleats for added room, elegance, and classic tailoring appeal<br>Pockets: Deep side slant pockets and rear welt pockets for practicality without bulk<br>Stitching: Clean precision stitching with reinforced seams for long-term durability<br>Front Crease: Sharp pressed crease to maintain a formal, structured appearance<br><strong>Comfort &amp; Durability Features<\\/strong><br>Breathable fabric suitable for long office hours or events<br>Adjustable waist for flexibility and comfort<br>Strong seam construction for repeated wear<br>Shape-retaining design that resists sagging and creasing<br><strong>Suitable Occasions<\\/strong><br>Perfect for business meetings, office wear, weddings, receptions, formal gatherings, dinner parties, smart-casual outings, and travel styling.<br><strong>Care Instructions<\\/strong><br>Dry clean recommended for best results, 40(\\r\\nC<br>Gentle machine wash if necessary<br>Do not bleach<br>Iron at low to medium temperature<br>Hang properly to preserve crease and waistband shape<br><strong>Available Sizes &amp; Colors<\\/strong><br>Sizes: 28, 30, 32, 34, 36, 38, 40(<br>Ccustomized olorssiolorssiolorszolorssiolorssiolorszolorse : Sand Beige (also available in Cream, Black, Charcoal Grey, and Navy Blue)<br>A timeless Gurkha trouser that blends classic military heritage with contemporary tailoring \\u2014 ideal for men who value precision fit, comfort, and understated sophistication.<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"4f37d555-ecac-4049-81c7-9825bfbefbae.webp\",\"b7695d2b-9950-454e-9c8e-cb4d6b53acd5.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"specification_table_id\":null,\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"SF-2443-XOYI\",\"price\":\"2000\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"price_includes_tax\":\"0\",\"cost_per_item\":\"0\",\"product_id\":\"546\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":\"0\",\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"weight\":\"0\",\"length\":\"0\",\"wide\":\"0\",\"height\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"related_products\":null,\"faq_schema_config\":[[{\"key\":\"question\",\"value\":null},{\"key\":\"answer\",\"value\":null}]],\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"seo_description\":null,\"index\":\"index\"},\"seo_meta_image\":null,\"status\":\"published\",\"is_featured\":\"1\",\"is_new_until\":null,\"categories\":[\"33\",\"35\",\"37\"],\"brand_id\":null,\"image\":\"b7695d2b-9950-454e-9c8e-cb4d6b53acd5.webp\",\"product_collections\":[\"1\"],\"product_labels\":[\"1\",\"2\"],\"minimum_order_quantity\":\"0\",\"maximum_order_quantity\":\"0\",\"tag\":null,\"submitter\":\"save\"}','updated','Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','103.239.7.113',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User',546,'Menâ€™s Premium Sand Beige Gurkha Tailored Trousers â€“ Modern Fit','primary','2026-04-23 13:01:10','2026-04-23 13:01:10'),(3602,3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','to the system',NULL,'logged in','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0;