ntent-max-width) flex-1 group\\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\\\"><div class=\\\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\\\"><div class=\\\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\\\"><div class=\\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\\\"><div class=\\\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\\\"><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Fabric Composition &amp; Material Quality<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Crafted from a premium <strong>poly-viscose stretch blend fabric<\\/strong>, these trousers deliver exceptional durability, wrinkle resistance, and breathable comfort. The smooth matte texture enhances luxury appeal while maintaining lightweight performance suitable for year-round wear.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Fit Type<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Modern Slim Fit<\\/strong> \\u2014 comfortably structured at the waist with a naturally tapered leg, creating a sharp elongated silhouette while allowing easy movement.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Design Details<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Signature Gurkha extended waistband with adjustable side buckle strap for a belt-free tailored finish<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Reinforced single-button closure with concealed zip fly<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Elegant double front pleats providing improved comfort and refined drape<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Deep functional side pockets with clean back welt pockets<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Sharp pressed front crease enhancing formal elegance<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Soft inner waistband lining for additional comfort<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Precision reinforced stitching ensuring long-lasting durability<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Comfort &amp; Durability Features<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Breathable lightweight fabric ideal for extended wear<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Stretch flexibility allowing natural movement<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Wrinkle-resistant finish maintains a crisp appearance<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Fade-resistant color technology for lasting freshness<\\/span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">\\u2714 Shape retention construction preserves structure and crease<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Suitable Occasions<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Ideal for weddings, formal ceremonies, executive office wear, business meetings, corporate events, evening receptions, smart casual gatherings, and luxury parties. Perfectly pairs with dress shirts, knit polos, blazers, loafers, or formal footwear for a refined gentleman\\u2019s style.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Care Instructions<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\">Dry clean recommended for best longevity. Gentle cold machine wash if necessary. Avoid bleach or harsh detergents. Steam or low-heat iron recommended. Store on a hanger to maintain crease and structure.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Available Sizes &amp; Colors<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\\\"><strong>Sizes:<\\/strong> 28, 3